# Website assets served through the public/storage symlink.
#
# The site's own images, stylesheets, scripts, videos and PDFs live here and
# ARE tracked, so a fresh clone renders every page. Only junk is ignored.
#
# To keep binaries out of git instead (as the old core-PHP repo did with
# assets/), replace this file's rules with:
#   *
#   !.gitignore

!*
!*/

*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
